  m_text: "Bandit Shooter VR\r\n\r\nInstructions:\r\n-\tDefend the bank from waves
    of bandits trying to rob the town.\r\n-\tEach wave spawns a set of enemies with
    different strengths and speeds.\r\n-\tIf the robbers reach the bank, cash will
    be reduced from the pool.\r\n-\tYour task is to shoot the bandits before they
    reach the bank.\r\n\r\nControls:\r\n-\tMove camera: Tilt phone in VR mode\r\n-\tShoot:
    Tap phone screen\r\n-\tReload when you run out of ammo:\r\n1.\tTilt phone left
    to open gun chamber\r\n2.\tTilt phone up to drop the empty casings\r\n3.\tTilt
    phone back down and close the chamber by tilting right"
